<title>USA: TransTechnology Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>TransTechnology Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.50		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			  2,618		    2,273</p>
<p> Sales		     47,613		   46,869</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,197		    5,099</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.74		    $1.45</p>
<p> Net			  8,788		    7.374</p>
<p> Sales		    178,684		  158,024</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,064		    5,093</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: All periods ended March 31</p>
<p>Before losses from discontinued operations, earnings per share were $0.55 in Q4 1997 and $0.52 in Q4 1996.</p>
<p>Before losses from discontinued operations, earnings per share were $1.92 in fiscal 1997 and $1.67 in fiscal 1996.</p>
